    "detailed_description": "<h1>CORE FEATURES</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/07d90f8b9dc5b5daee4e9bdb834fb09b.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/6523b21339d22be98cb271bf6b32664f.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u26a1\u00a0<strong>Team up and power through</strong> \u2013 Use energy management abilities to charge machines and solve puzzles together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83e\udd16\u00a0<strong>Battle virus bots</strong> \u2013 Outsmart digital foes with teamwork and quick thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<strong>Explore a digital world</strong> \u2013 Traverse neon circuits, CPU pathways, and other computer biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Play your way</strong> \u2013 Enjoy seamless <strong>online or split-screen co-op</strong>, or tackle the adventure solo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Join the Antivirus Special Forces</strong> \u2013 Control adorable yet powerful droids on a mission to save the system</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside the computer and join forces with your friend in <strong>Bytebond</strong>, an exhilarating co-op adventure where teamwork is the ultimate weapon. Explore multiple biomes, each teeming with new foes and mind-bending puzzles. Using your unique energy management abilities, collaborate with a friend in an online or classic split-screen environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/a849241e4cd57aa5fd9fd7e1d70f7fe5.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Players collaborate to achieve common goals and overcome challenges together. Join forces to charge and convert energy, powering machines and solving puzzles to progress through levels. Don't have someone by your side? No worries; single-player mode is available too!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Compete against a range of digital foes and virus bots while navigating difficult puzzles that need seamless teamwork and strategy. Adapt your techniques to defeat each individual adversary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/f0e4e3addba857e44af1f38d523a3be2.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Biomes</strong> - Traverse through different computer components, from the neon-lit circuits of the motherboard to the intricate pathways of the CPU. Each biome brings its unique set of enemies and puzzle challenges, keeping you on your toes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Antivirus Special Forces</strong> - Engage on an operation unlike any other, where fast thinking and teamwork are critical to victory. You are not only a special unit... but also cute chubby droids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seamless Co-op Experience</strong> - Whether you prefer online play or classic split-screen, Bytebond offers a seamless experience with a controller support steering.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside the computer and join forces with your friend in <strong>Bytebond</strong>, an exhilarating co-op adventure where teamwork is the ultimate weapon. Explore multiple biomes, each teeming with new foes and mind-bending puzzles. Using your unique energy management abilities, collaborate with a friend in an online or classic split-screen environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/8bc2c6815a034e31b3dd2e9a36fed95a.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/a849241e4cd57aa5fd9fd7e1d70f7fe5.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Players collaborate to achieve common goals and overcome challenges together. Join forces to charge and convert energy, powering machines and solving puzzles to progress through levels. Don't have someone by your side? No worries; single-player mode is available too!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Compete against a range of digital foes and virus bots while navigating difficult puzzles that need seamless teamwork and strategy. Adapt your techniques to defeat each individual adversary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/14b4fb6d2dc61c149b66761b400fbab5.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/f0e4e3addba857e44af1f38d523a3be2.avif?t=1754383987\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Biomes</strong> - Traverse through different computer components, from the neon-lit circuits of the motherboard to the intricate pathways of the CPU. Each biome brings its unique set of enemies and puzzle challenges, keeping you on your toes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Antivirus Special Forces</strong> - Engage on an operation unlike any other, where fast thinking and teamwork are critical to victory. You are not only a special unit... but also cute chubby droids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.poster.avif?t=1754383987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.webm?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/5c27d41139345db11711da1b5816197b.mp4?t=1754383987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seamless Co-op Experience</strong> - Whether you prefer online play or classic split-screen, Bytebond offers a seamless experience with a controller support steering.</p>",
    "short_description": "Split Fiction meets Portal! Bytebond is an electrifying online &amp; couch co-op puzzle game that challenges you to regain control over an infected CPU. Dive into the heart of a PC with your friend and become the ultimate Antivirus Special Forces duo.",
